[112.808375, "o", "in one transaction; a failure leaves the last complete page as the restart point.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[112.80854, "o", "A run with no new changes makes one request at the saved cursor, without replaying\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[112.80865, "o", "old pages. Existing append-only catalogs are migrated to one row per SKU (highest\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[112.808744, "o", "feed sequence, then latest inserted row wins); product column names are unchanged.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[112.808816, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[112.808917, "o", "Supplier notices are logged for operators. A `notice_ack_required` response is\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[112.80893, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[112.808988, "o", "logged and retried at the same cursor with `X-Notice-Ack`. Notice text does not\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[112.809584, "o", "execute local actions or change merchandising overrides. Active, future, and\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> expired override history is preserved by sync; expired overrides are ignored for\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> pricing and can be removed explicitly with `overrides prune-expired` if desired.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> An invalid/other-epoch cursor fails visibly rather than silently replaying a\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> potentially incomplete history.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> '''\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> p.write_text(s)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> PY\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
